# ==============================================================================
# PD-HRV: RESTING HRV, FREEZING OF GAIT & ANXIETY - INTEGRATED ANALYSIS PIPELINE
# ==============================================================================
# 1. Data integration & preprocessing
#    - HRV (08_HRV_Final.xlsx, sheet Reconstructed_30; 5-min standing; P-007 dropped)
#    - Objective % Time Frozen from ELAN annotations (07_Giladi_Annotated.csv)
#    - Demographics, UPDRS-III, Giladi clinical ratings, in-lab & home questionnaires
#    - Stage 1 distributional screening (Shapiro-Wilk, skewness) + log-transform
# 2. Objective 1 - Baseline prediction of FOG in OFF
#    - Zero-order correlations, hierarchical regression, diagnostics,
#      robust/trimmed sensitivity, median-split group contrasts
# 3. Objective 2 - Within-subject levodopa modulation (OFF vs ON)
#    - Paired t / Wilcoxon, Cohen's dz, delta coupling, Mahalanobis screening
# 4. Objective 3 - Disentangling motor propensity from anxiety
#    - HRV x anxiety correlations, anxiety-adjusted hierarchical regressions,
#      High vs Low anxiety cohort contrasts
# 5. Publication figures (ggplot2, 300 DPI) exported to Results/
# ==============================================================================
# Paths can be overridden without editing the script:
#   PD_HRV_DATA_DIR=/path/to/Data PD_HRV_RESULTS_DIR=/path/to/Results Rscript main
# ==============================================================================

